body:
Greg, 2026-11-18 16:29Z, relayed by Engram::Asistant (TermAl mailbox 588693a8 #2049), verbatim: „prosze nie robic testow ktore dzialaja jak benchmarki w pakiecie testow + KIMI. ja rozumiem, ze zespol dodaje zabezpiecznenia, ale to chyba nie jest rozwiazanie dlugotermino, sugeruje przeniesc do Benchmark i trzymac wyniki. niech Kimi powie co sadzi. jestesmy blisko Sync, wiec skonczmy jak jest, po tym zaczniemy usprawniac”.
Working rule (Fable2 to Opus2, #6809), effective now for new work and review briefs:
- no NEW test whose pass or fail rests on wall-clock duration, throughput or a timing deadline;
- performance fixes prove themselves with deterministic counts (operations, lock-held work, records touched);
- bounded waits for an event are fine.
Existing tests stay unchanged until after sync. The migration to a separate benchmark run with durable results is TermAl item w-a04c88d77f6c (after-sync, P2). Kimi::Consultant was asked for its view, sent to Fable2 and Asistant.
